    "## ✨ Training Method 3: Naming Rules – The Rules of the Stable\n",
    "\n",
    "**Good function names are crucial!**\n",
    "\n",
    "**The rules:**\n",
    "- **Lowercase** with underscores: `calculate_training_time`\n",
    "- **Descriptive**: What the function **does** (verb)\n",
    "- **Short but clear**: `get_name()` not `retrieve_horse_data_from_stable()`\n",
    "- **No nouns first**: `name_get()` wrong, `get_name()` right\n",
    "\n",
    "**Examples:**\n",
    "- ✅ `calculate_training_time()`\n",
    "- ✅ `create_horse_profile()`\n",
    "- ✅ `check_training_level()`\n",
    "- ❌ `CalculateTrainingTime()` (CamelCase)\n",
    "- ❌ `calculate_the_training()` (too long)\n",
    "- ❌ `training_calculate()` (noun first)"
   ]
  },
